      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是，这样真的好吗。只想着米浴，\n而没能让目白麦昆全力奔跑的话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d5c1b11d9d61aa9e6ea82fb59c3b4654d6eab0befe4a23e64cda3a29cab88b9",
