    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cd73ecedf480607377a0ad8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "话先放在这里，我可没打算输。作为目白家的赛马娘，\n我会达成『天皇赏』3连霸的伟业的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a74408965b9780007483472c4f0713bec435f2ff9fde0492c0e2911b61deea5",
