      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白麦昆如同恶作剧一般笑了。\n但是，对于春季『天皇赏』，她是相当认真的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "85cfc7c737ac2f20e657e41141041fb9c6a7abefec808e5f0dbf0871b3703c83",
